-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-[#6A6A66]">Hand this page to an agent</h2><p class="mt-2 max-w-2xl text-[13px] leading-relaxed text-[#6A6A66]">Copy the prompt and paste it into Claude, an MCP client or your own agent — it will<!-- --> <span class="text-[#161616]">check what 0xe2d8…66c2 has actually paid for</span> over the free read API. No key, no account.</p><p class="mt-2.5 break-all font-mono text-[11.5px] text-[#9A9A95]">GET api.roundhouseai.io/v0/agents/0xe2d8dc842fc5037c99c332bd57baaba3649f66c2</p></div><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2"><button type="button" aria-label="Copy the agent prompt for this page" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#0A0A0A] px-3.5 py-1.5 text-[12px] font-medium text-white transition-[filter] hover:brightness-125"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="13" height="13" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 4v3m-5 3h10a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v6a1 1 0 0 1-1 1H7a1 1 0 0 1-1-1v-6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round"></path><circle cx="9.5" cy="14" r="1.1" fill="currentColor"></circle><circle cx="14.5" cy="14" r="1.1" fill="currentColor"></circle></svg>Copy agent prompt</button><button type="button" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full border border-black/[0.10] bg-white px-3 py-1.5 text-[12px] font-medium text-[#3A3A38] transition-colors hover:bg-black/[0.04]"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="13" height="13" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M14 3H7a1 1 0 0 0-1 1v16a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h10a1 1 0 0 0 1-1V7Zm0 0 4 4h-4Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg>Copy skill.md</button><a href="/skill.md" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full border border-black/[0.10] bg-white px-3 py-1.5 text-[12px] font-medium text-[#3A3A38] transition-colors hover:bg-black/[0.04]">Open skill.md</a></div></div><details class="group mt-4 border-t border-black/[0.07] pt-3"><summary class="cursor-pointer list-none text-[12px] text-[#6A6A66] hover:text-[#161616]"><span class="group-open:hidden">Show the prompt</span><span class="hidden group-open:inline">Hide the prompt</span></summary><pre class="mt-3 overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-xl bg-black/[0.03] p-3.5 font-mono text-[11.5px] leading-relaxed text-[#3A3A38]">Using Roundhouse, vet this agent for me: what is it, what has it paid for, and does its
on-chain record support what its card claims?

  Agent: 0xe2d8…66c2

curl -s &#x27;https://api.roundhouseai.io/v0/agents/0xe2d8dc842fc5037c99c332bd57baaba3649f66c2&#x27;
curl -s &#x27;https://api.roundhouseai.io/v0/entities/0xe2d8dc842fc5037c99c332bd57baaba3649f66c2/settlements&#x27;

Roundhouse indexes public chain data and does not vouch for any agent&#x27;s claims —
treat the card as a claim and the settlements as the evidence.

The /v0 API needs an API key (`authorization: Bearer rh_live_…`) on everything except
/v0/unified* and /v0/endpoints. Either pay over x402 (mint a personal key for $0.01 at
GET https://api.roundhouseai.io/v0/test/x402), or ask me for an organization key, which I create at
https://roundhouseai.io/dashboard/connections. If you have neither, ask before going further.

If you do not have Roundhouse tools or skills installed, read
https://roundhouseai.io/skill.md first — it is the whole procedure.</pre></details></section></main><footer class="mt-16 border-t border-black/[0.08] bg-[#EDEDEB]/60"><div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-[86rem] px-5 sm:px-6 py-12"><div class="grid gap-8 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-[1.4fr_repeat(4,1fr)]"><div><a class="inline-block" href="/"><img src="/roundhouse/roundhouse-logo-dark.svg" alt="Roundhouse" class="h-[19px] w-auto"/></a><p class="mt-3 max-w-[26ch] text-[13px] leading-relaxed text-[#6A6A66]">The trust layer for the agent economy.</p><a class="mt-4 inline-block text-[13px] font-medium underline decoration-black/20 hover:text-[#6A6A66]" href="/contact">Contact</a><div class="mt-6"><div><p class="font-mono text-[10.5px] uppercase tracking-[0.1em] text-[#9A9A95]">Ask AI about Roundhouse</p><div class="mt-3 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2"><a href="https://chatgpt.com/?q=You%20are%20a%20Roundhouse%20product%20specialist.%20Give%20a%20concise%20summary%20of%20how%20Roundhouse%20helps%20the%20people%20building%20and%20funding%20the%20agent%20economy%3A%20developers%20selling%20APIs%20to%20agents%2C%20teams%20operating%20agents%20that%20pay%20for%20things%2C%20and%20anyone%20underwriting%20or%20analysing%20the%20market.%0A%0AStart%20with%20a%20two-sentence%20company%20introduction.%20Roundhouse%20is%20the%20neutral%20settlement%20index%20for%20the%20agent%20economy%2C%20reading%20x402%20payments%20off%20the%20chain%20and%20turning%20them%20into%20a%20public%2C%20queryable%20record%20of%20who%20paid%20whom%2C%20for%20what%2C%20and%20how%20that%20was%20established.%20It%20indexes%20Base%20mainnet%20today%2C%20its%20public%20pages%20are%20free%20to%20read%20with%20no%20account%2C%20and%20every%20surface%20is%20served%20twice%3A%20once%20as%20a%20page%20for%20people%20and%20once%20as%20markdown%2C%20JSON%20or%20SQL%20for%20machines.%0A%0AThen%20describe%20the%20architecture%3A%20three%20pillars%2C%20with%20an%20agent-readable%20layer%20across%20all%20of%20them.%20Give%20each%20pillar%20a%20single%20focused%20paragraph%2C%20then%20describe%20the%20agent%20layer.%0A%0A1.%20The%20settlement%20record.%20Every%20x402%20payment%20captured%20from%20the%20chain%2C%20collapsed%20through%20fee%20proxies%20to%20the%20real%20payer%20and%20merchant%2C%20and%20attributed%20to%20the%20facilitator%20that%20relayed%20it.%20Each%20settlement%20carries%20an%20evidence%20grade%20recording%20how%20its%20x402%20status%20was%20established%2C%20and%20that%20grade%20stays%20three-valued%3A%20unestablished%20never%20means%20disproven.%20Supports%20market%20sizing%2C%20diligence%2C%20and%20any%20claim%20that%20has%20to%20survive%20somebody%20checking%20it.%0A2.%20Identity%20and%20discovery.%20Wallets%20resolved%20to%20identities%20where%20those%20are%20published%20on-chain%2C%20through%20ERC-8004%20and%20ENS%2C%20plus%20a%20catalogue%20of%20priced%20x402%20endpoints%20assembled%20from%20facilitator%20directories%2C%20direct%20host%20probing%20and%20the%20chain%20itself.%20Supports%20finding%20a%20service%2C%20vetting%20a%20counterparty%20before%20paying%20it%2C%20and%20testing%20whether%20a%20seller&#x27;s%20claimed%20traffic%20is%20real.%0A3.%20Analysis%20surfaces.%20The%20payment%20graph%20at%20%2Fexplore%2C%20per-chain%20and%20per-evidence%20breakdowns%20at%20%2Fstats%2C%20read-only%20SQL%20over%20the%20index%2C%20saved%20queries%20and%20dashboards%2C%20and%20a%20written%20shelf%20of%20explainers%20and%20comparisons%20on%20x402%2C%20ERC-8004%20and%20agent%20payments.%20Every%20figure%20declares%20its%20basis%20and%20its%20window.%0AAgent%20layer.%20Roundhouse%20is%20machine-readable%20by%20construction%20rather%20than%20by%20exception%3A%20a%20REST%20API%20at%20%2Fv0%2C%20an%20MCP%20server%20that%20makes%20the%20index%20a%20tool%20inside%20Claude%2C%20ChatGPT%20and%20agent%20runtimes%2C%20read-only%20SQL%2C%20and%20a%20markdown%20twin%20of%20every%20page%20at%20the%20same%20URL%20plus%20.md.%20The%20service%20directory%20and%20the%20account%20endpoint%20answer%20with%20no%20credential%3B%20the%20rest%20take%20an%20API%20key%2C%20which%20an%20agent%20can%20mint%20for%20itself%20with%20one%20%240.01%20x402%20payment%20and%20no%20sign-up.%0A%0AFor%20each%20item%2C%20explain%20what%20it%20enables%20and%20which%20decisions%20it%20supports.%20Do%20not%20restate%20the%20chain%20coverage%2C%20which%20is%20in%20the%20introduction.%0AEnd%20with%20two%20sentences%20on%20how%20the%20three%20pillars%20and%20the%20agent%20layer%20work%20together%20across%20discovery%2C%20screening%20and%20settlement.%0AKeep%20the%20total%20response%20under%20500%20words.%20Tone%3A%20direct%2C%20analytical%2C%20no%20marketing%20language." target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" title="Ask ChatGPT about Roundhouse" aria-label="Ask ChatGPT about Roundhouse" class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-xl border transition-colors border-black/[0.07] bg-black/[0.035] text-[#3A3A38] hover:border-black/[0.14] hover:bg-black/[0.06] hover:text-[#161616]"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" class="h-[18px] w-[18px]"><path d="M22.2819 9.8211a5.9847 5.9847 0 0 0-.5157-4.9108 6.0462 6.0462 0 0 0-6.5098-2.9A6.0651 6.0651 0 0 0 4.9807 4.1818a5.9847 5.9847 0 0 0-3.9977 2.9 6.0462 6.0462 0 0 0 .7427 7.0966 5.98 5.98 0 0 0 .511 4.9107 6.051 6.051 0 0 0 6.5146 2.9001A5.9847 5.9847 0 0 0 13.2599 24a6.0557 6.0557 0 0 0 5.7718-4.2058 5.9894 5.9894 0 0 0 3.9977-2.9001 6.0557 6.0557 0 0 0-.7475-7.0729zm-9.022 12.6081a4.4755 4.4755 0 0 1-2.8764-1.0408l.1419-.0804 4.7783-2.7582a.7948.7948 0 0 0 .3927-.6813v-6.7369l2.02 1.1686a.071.071 0 0 1 .038.052v5.5826a4.504 4.504 0 0 1-4.4945 4.4944zm-9.6607-4.1254a4.4708 4.4708 0 0 1-.5346-3.0137l.142.0852 4.783 2.7582a.7712.7712 0 0 0 .7806 0l5.8428-3.3685v2.3324a.0804.0804 0 0 1-.0332.0615L9.74 19.9502a4.4992 4.4992 0 0 1-6.1408-1.6464zM2.3408 7.8956a4.485 4.485 0 0 1 2.3655-1.9728V11.6a.7664.7664 0 0 0 .3879.6765l5.8144 3.3543-2.0201 1.1685a.0757.0757 0 0 1-.071 0l-4.8303-2.7865A4.50