and%20attributed%20to%20the%20facilitator%20that%20relayed%20it.%20Each%20settlement%20carries%20an%20evidence%20grade%20recording%20how%20its%20x402%20status%20was%20established%2C%20and%20that%20grade%20stays%20three-valued%3A%20unestablished%20never%20means%20disproven.%20Supports%20market%20sizing%2C%20diligence%2C%20and%20any%20claim%20that%20has%20to%20survive%20somebody%20checking%20it.%0A2.%20Identity%20and%20discovery.%20Wallets%20resolved%20to%20identities%20where%20those%20are%20published%20on-chain%2C%20through%20ERC-8004%20and%20ENS%2C%20plus%20a%20catalogue%20of%20priced%20x402%20endpoints%20assembled%20from%20facilitator%20directories%2C%20direct%20host%20probing%20and%20the%20chain%20itself.%20Supports%20finding%20a%20service%2C%20vetting%20a%20counterparty%20before%20paying%20it%2C%20and%20testing%20whether%20a%20seller&#x27;s%20claimed%20traffic%20is%20real.%0A3.%20Analysis%20surfaces.%20The%20payment%20graph%20at%20%2Fexplore%2C%20per-chain%20and%20per-evidence%20breakdowns%20at%20%2Fstats%2C%20read-only%20SQL%20over%20the%20index%2C%20saved%20queries%20and%20dashboards%2C%20and%20a%20written%20shelf%20of%20explainers%20and%20comparisons%20on%20x402%2C%20ERC-8004%20and%20agent%20payments.%20Every%20figure%20declares%20its%20basis%20and%20its%20window.%0AAgent%20layer.%20Roundhouse%20is%20machine-readable%20by%20construction%20rather%20than%20by%20exception%3A%20a%20REST%20API%20at%20%2Fv0%2C%20an%20MCP%20server%20that%20makes%20the%20index%20a%20tool%20inside%20Claude%2C%20ChatGPT%20and%20agent%20runtimes%2C%20read-only%20SQL%2C%20and%20a%20markdown%20twin%20of%20every%20page%20at%20the%20same%20URL%20plus%20.md.%20The%20service%20directory%20and%20the%20account%20endpoint%20answer%20with%20no%20credential%3B%20the%20rest%20take%20an%20API%20key%2C%20which%20an%20agent%20can%20mint%20for%20itself%20with%20one%20%240.01%20x402%20payment%20and%20no%20sign-up.%0A%0AFor%20each%20item%2C%20explain%20what%20it%20enables%20and%20which%20decisions%20it%20