%20never%20means%20disproven.%20Supports%20market%20sizing%2C%20diligence%2C%20and%20any%20claim%20that%20has%20to%20survive%20somebody%20checking%20it.%0A2.%20Identity%20and%20discovery.%20Wallets%20resolved%20to%20identities%20where%20those%20are%20published%20on-chain%2C%20through%20ERC-8004%20and%20ENS%2C%20plus%20a%20catalogue%20of%20priced%20x402%20endpoints%20assembled%20from%20facilitator%20directories%2C%20direct%20host%20probing%20and%20the%20chain%20itself.%20Supports%20finding%20a%20service%2C%20vetting%20a%20counterparty%20before%20paying%20it%2C%20and%20testing%20whether%20a%20seller&#x27;s%20claimed%20traffic%20is%20real.%0A3.%20Analysis%20surfaces.%20The%20payment%20graph%20at%20%2Fexplore%2C%20per-chain%20and%20per-evidence%20breakdowns%20at%20%2Fstats%2C%20read-only%20SQL%20over%20the%20index%2C%20saved%20queries%20and%20dashboards%2C%20and%20a%20written%20shelf%20of%20explainers%20and%20comparisons%20on%20x402%2C%20ERC-8004%20and%20agent%20payments.%20Every%20figure%20declares%20its%20basis%20and%20its%20window.%0AAgent%20layer.%20Roundhouse%20is%20machine-readable%20by%20construction%20rather%20than%20by%20exception%3A%20a%20REST%20API%20at%20%2Fv0%2C%20an%20MCP%20server%20that%20makes%20the%20index%20a%20tool%20inside%20Claude%2C%20ChatGPT%20and%20agent%20runtimes%2C%20read-only%20SQL%2C%20and%20a%20markdown%20twin%20of%20every%20page%20at%20the%20same%20URL%20plus%20.md.%20The%20service%20directory%20and%20the%20account%20endpoint%20answer%20with%20no%20credential%3B%20the%20rest%20take%20an%20API%20key%2C%20which%20an%20agent%20can%20mint%20for%20itself%20with%20one%20%240.01%20x402%20payment%20and%20no%20sign-up.%0A%0AFor%20each%20item%2C%20explain%20what%20it%20enables%20and%20which%20decisions%20it%20supports.%20Do%20not%20restate%20the%20chain%20coverage%2C%20which%20is%20in%20the%20introduction.%0AEnd%20with%20two%20sentences%20on%20how%20the%20three%20pillars%20and%20the%20agent%20layer%20work%20together%20across%20discovery%2C%20screening%20and%20settlement.%0AKeep%20the%20total%20response%20under%20500%20words.%20Tone%3A%20direct%2C%20analytical%2C%20no%20marketing%20language." target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" title="Ask Grok about Roundhouse" aria-label="Ask Grok about Roundhouse" class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-xl border transition-colors border-black/[0.07] bg-black/[0.035] text-[#3A3A38] hover:border-black/[0.14] hover:bg-black/[0.06] hover:text-[#161616]"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" class="h-[18px] w-[18px]"><path d="M9.27 15.29l7.978-5.897c.391-.29.95-.177 1.137.272.98 2.369.542 5.215-1.422 7.185-1.964 1.97-4.728 2.39-7.083 1.43l-2.274 1.825c3.413 2.09 7.624 1.646 10.618-1.356 2.378-2.384 3.113-5.665 2.374-8.633l.007.005c-1.07-4.26.206-5.955 2.73-9.4.06-.082.12-.164.179-.248l-3.233 3.24v-.01L9.27 15.284M7.797 16.635c-2.686-2.556-2.221-6.549.023-8.799 1.657-1.662 4.37-2.333 6.74-1.3l2.27-1.823c-.431-.292-.986-.584-1.574-.805-3.138-1.336-6.969-.698-9.593 1.941-2.43 2.444-3.157 6.024-2.098 9.112 1.5 1.883-.69 4.914-2.956 7.96-.9.12-.18.24-.27.36l3.302-3.303 3.898-3.903"></path></svg></a><button type="button" title="Copy the prompt and open Gemini" aria-label="Copy the prompt and open Gemini. Gemini cannot be sent a prompt in a link." class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-xl border transition-colors border-black/[0.07] bg-black/[0.035] text-[#3A3A38] hover:border-black/[0.14] hover:bg-black/[0.06] hover:text-[#161616]"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" class="h-[18px] w-[18px]"><path d="M12 24A14.304 14.304 0 0 0 0 12 14.304 14.304 0 0 0 12 0a14.305 14.305 0 0 0 12 12 14.305 14.305 0 0 0-12 12"></path></svg></button></div><p aria-live="polite" class="mt-2 h-4 text-[12px] text-[#9A9A95]"></p></div></div></div><div><p class="font-mono text-[10.5px] uppercase tracking-[0.1em] text-[#9A9A95]">Explore the record</p><ul class="mt-3 space-y-2"><li><a class="text-[13px] text-[#3A3A38